{"4022970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Infinity Rising", "steam_appid": 4022970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Rising</i> is an open‑world sandbox set between Cornucopias, the Nation in the sky, and Earth Below. Players traverse both worlds to explore, gather, craft, build bases and land plots, trade in a player‑driven economy, and respond to rift‑related events and <strong>Terra</strong> through PvE. Survival and upkeep systems influence pace and markets, while casual and social play (farming, gardening, hubs, and co‑ops) stands alongside combat as a first‑class path to progress. With a vibrant 1960s retro‑futurist art direction and a “play your pace” philosophy, <i>Infinity Rising</i> turns individual action into shared momentum.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE ENDLESS LANDSCAPES FULL OF OPPORTUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate zones to collect loot, harvest resources, mine rich veins, hunt, and fish waterways. Use what you gather to survive, craft gear, build, and push deeper into each zone. Your place in a peer-to-peer (p2p) economy starts here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOP YOUR LAND, BE A MAJOR PLAYER IN THE ECONOMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm and tend your plot at your pace. Upgrade facilities and specialize production, then supply your town and district projects to unlock shared upgrades and seasonal rewards. Your land fuels the peer-to-peer economy and your community’s growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT THE WORLD FROM THREAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your part to keep the ARCs safe. Stand with your district against Rift incursions inside the domes and Terra aggression on Earth Below. Answer alerts, support defenses, and help keep trade flowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR HOME BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a home base that feels yours. Place and rotate pieces with precision, furnish interiors, and expand from a single room to a multi-level layout. Combine crafted parts and found décor to build functional spaces—workshops, storage, displays—and invite friends to see what you’ve made.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Infinity Rising</i> is an open‑world sandbox set between Cornucopias, the Nation in the sky, and Earth Below. Players traverse both worlds to explore, gather, craft, build bases and land plots, trade in a player‑driven economy, and respond to rift‑related events and <strong>Terra</strong> through PvE. Survival and upkeep systems influence pace and markets, while casual and social play (farming, gardening, hubs, and co‑ops) stands alongside combat as a first‑class path to progress. With a vibrant 1960s retro‑futurist art direction and a “play your pace” philosophy, <i>Infinity Rising</i> turns individual action into shared momentum.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE ENDLESS LANDSCAPES FULL OF OPPORTUNITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate zones to collect loot, harvest resources, mine rich veins, hunt, and fish waterways. Use what you gather to survive, craft gear, build, and push deeper into each zone. Your place in a peer-to-peer (p2p) economy starts here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOP YOUR LAND, BE A MAJOR PLAYER IN THE ECONOMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm and tend your plot at your pace. Upgrade facilities and specialize production, then supply your town and district projects to unlock shared upgrades and seasonal rewards. Your land fuels the peer-to-peer economy and your community’s growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROTECT THE WORLD FROM THREAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do your part to keep the ARCs safe. Stand with your district against Rift incursions inside the domes and Terra aggression on Earth Below. Answer alerts, support defenses, and help keep trade flowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR HOME BASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design a home base that feels yours. Place and rotate pieces with precision, furnish interiors, and expand from a single room to a multi-level layout. Combine crafted parts and found décor to build functional spaces—workshops, storage, displays—and invite friends to see what you’ve made.</p>", "short_description": "Infinity Rising is an open‑world sandbox set between Cornucopias—the Nation in the Sky—and Earth Below. Players traverse both worlds to explore, gather, craft, build bases and land plots, trade in a player‑driven economy, and respond to rift‑related events and Terra through PvE.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022970/33e72a5fc73be90fc1fb6cb9f1bed1b0787a60f9/header.jpg?t=1764081877", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022970/5b1ec58f7e41d8b68aaf529bb1d75aeb924efb60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764081877", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022970/5b1ec58f7e41d8b68aaf529bb1d75aeb924efb60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764081877", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-10400k (6 core 2.9 GHz) or AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6 core 3.6 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2080 (8GB) or NVIDIA RTX 3060 (8GB) or AMD RX 5700 XT (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-10700k (8 core 5.0 GHz) or AMD Ryzen 7 5800X (8 core 3.8 GHz) or greater<br></li><li><s